WEBVTT

NOTE
Canonical written narration timed from the exact local narration render receipt.
Pronunciation-only substitutions are intentionally absent from caption text.

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:05.322
The Transformer is a powerful implementation, not the definition of cognition.

2
00:00:05.322 --> 00:00:10.585
Yet a stack can claim architectural freedom while baking token, attention-cache,

3
00:00:10.585 --> 00:00:14.890
positional, checkpoint, and serving assumptions into every surrounding layer.

4
00:00:15.230 --> 00:00:19.782
Then a state-space model, recurrent network, test-time learner, graph system,

5
00:00:19.782 --> 00:00:24.335
exact program, or future substrate is replaceable only on paper.

6
00:00:24.675 --> 00:00:28.162
This chapter proposes a typed Cognitive Kernel ABI:

7
00:00:28.162 --> 00:00:32.956
a boundary that lets routes use the best qualified implementation for

8
00:00:32.956 --> 00:00:37.315
an exact job while identity, authority, evidence, memory, cost, fallback,

9
00:00:37.315 --> 00:00:39.930
and recovery remain stable above it.

10
00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:44.612
The ABI is not a lowest-common-denominator forward function.

11
00:00:44.612 --> 00:00:50.226
A request binds task, consumer, modality, context handles, exact state handles,

12
00:00:50.226 --> 00:00:55.329
authority ceiling, resource budget, stop policy, required evidence, fallback, hardware,

13
00:00:55.329 --> 00:00:56.860
and time horizon.

14
00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:02.084
A kernel returns a proposal, uncertainty or residual, evidence handles,

15
00:01:02.084 --> 00:01:07.456
requested effects, requested authority, state delta, checkpoint, cost and assistance receipts,

16
00:01:07.456 --> 00:01:12.828
kernel identity, version, state schema, and non-claims. The kernel may propose

17
00:01:12.828 --> 00:01:13.805
an effect.

18
00:01:14.145 --> 00:01:17.977
It may not commit one, mint authority, forge a receipt,

19
00:01:17.977 --> 00:01:21.425
choose its only evaluator, or silently alter durable state.

20
00:01:22.025 --> 00:01:27.699
This boundary preserves differences rather than pretending they do not exist.

21
00:01:27.699 --> 00:01:33.374
Transformers expose attention and key-value state. State-space and recurrent systems compress

22
00:01:33.374 --> 00:01:39.048
history into evolving state. Test-time-learning systems mutate parameters or fast memory

23
00:01:39.048 --> 00:01:40.080
during inference.

24
00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:45.791
External-memory controllers add addressable stores. KANs change function parameterization.

25
00:01:45.791 --> 00:01:52.354
Graph and message-passing systems encode relation structure. Diffusion-style generators revise parallel

26
00:01:52.354 --> 00:01:57.725
states. Programs and search can preserve exact symbolic branches.

27
00:01:58.065 --> 00:02:02.225
Each family has different checkpoint, deletion, calibration, hardware, memory,

28
00:02:02.225 --> 00:02:07.309
and failure semantics. If an adapter cannot preserve a required exact

29
00:02:07.309 --> 00:02:09.620
field, the route is rejected.

30
00:02:10.220 --> 00:02:15.233
Above the ABI, reflex, reaction, deliberation, and specialist routers select candidates

31
00:02:15.233 --> 00:02:20.245
by qualified capability rather than fashion. A reflex may be a

32
00:02:20.245 --> 00:02:25.258
deterministic rule, small KAN, or recurrent cell. A streaming reaction may

33
00:02:25.258 --> 00:02:26.625
use an SSM.

34
00:02:26.965 --> 00:02:32.217
Deliberation may combine a general model, exact executor, learned critic,

35
00:02:32.217 --> 00:02:37.995
and branch-preserving search. Every receipt credits retrieval, tools, search, verifiers, adapters,

36
00:02:37.995 --> 00:02:39.045
and hardware.

37
00:02:39.385 --> 00:02:44.004
This prevents a tiny central model from receiving credit for intelligence

38
00:02:44.004 --> 00:02:47.782
supplied by a huge corpus, hand-authored skills, expensive voting,

39
00:02:47.782 --> 00:02:52.401
or hidden outer search. Keep-it-simple means the smallest complete governed system,

40
00:02:52.401 --> 00:02:55.340
not the smallest box in the diagram.

41
00:02:55.940 --> 00:03:00.770
Architectural recursive self-improvement is therefore more than shuffling weights.

42
00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:04.756
A system may propose a new computational structure,

43
00:03:04.756 --> 00:03:09.769
train it in isolation, test conformance and capability with independent-enough evaluators,

44
00:03:09.769 --> 00:03:14.782
compare strong baselines at equal active parameters and equal total lifecycle

45
00:03:14.782 --> 00:03:19.340
cost, shadow it without effect authority, canary it with fallback,

46
00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:24.504
and then promote, narrow, combine, quarantine, roll back, or retire it.

47
00:03:24.504 --> 00:03:29.329
Failed comparisons and descendants remain visible. A candidate can help design

48
00:03:29.329 --> 00:03:33.715
its successor, but cannot select the only data, threshold, evaluator,

49
00:03:33.715 --> 00:03:36.785
or promotion record used to approve itself.

50
00:03:37.385 --> 00:03:40.930
OneCell illustrates how a candidate should lose cleanly.

51
00:03:40.930 --> 00:03:45.803
It imagines a compact weight-tied recurrent cell over typed latent lanes,

52
00:03:45.803 --> 00:03:50.234
with exact memory, identity, effects, and receipts outside the cell;

53
00:03:50.234 --> 00:03:54.665
inner recurrence refines proposals while outer exact search preserves branches.

54
00:03:55.005 --> 00:03:59.510
The idea loses if adapters, retrieval, tools, or search contain the

55
00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:03.606
answer; if addressable memory is hidden in a growing cache;

56
00:04:03.606 --> 00:04:07.701
if recurrence fails beyond trained depth; if typed lanes interfere;

57
00:04:07.701 --> 00:04:12.206
or if a strong Transformer or hybrid wins on usefulness, safety,

58
00:04:12.206 --> 00:04:13.435
rights, latency, energy,

59
00:04:13.775 --> 00:04:18.608
and lifecycle cost. The current repository also has one non-Transformer count-table

60
00:04:18.608 --> 00:04:23.440
trace showing that the interface shell need not depend on attention.

61
00:04:23.440 --> 00:04:26.955
That is plumbing, not a competitive architecture result.

62
00:04:27.555 --> 00:04:31.774
The chapter remains Design rationale at argument support.

63
00:04:31.774 --> 00:04:36.520
A sixteen-case synthetic ABI checker rejects twelve malicious mutations,

64
00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:42.321
but the matched heterogeneous-kernel tournament produced zero outcome runs because the

65
00:04:42.321 --> 00:04:45.485
candidate and strongest-comparator envelope was unavailable.

66
00:04:45.825 --> 00:04:51.623
The historical KERC implementation was inadequate, leaving only two narrow finite

67
00:04:51.623 --> 00:04:56.894
observations with no semantic, multilingual, production, energy, or core claim.

68
00:04:56.894 --> 00:04:59.530
No architecture wins this video.

69
00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:04.183
The next chapter, Relational Dimension Compilation and Polyadic Cognition,

70
00:05:04.183 --> 00:05:09.454
takes one higher-order proposal through a stricter lifecycle while preserving lower-order

71
00:05:09.454 --> 00:05:14.725
rescue, reversible contraction, evidence boundaries, and the right to reject it.
